# Global fd ignores (gitignore syntax), on top of .gitignore and git's global
# excludes. Keeps fd, and the fzf ctrl-t/alt-c/** lists built on it, fast from
# ~. `fd -u` searches everything anyway.
#
# Patterns with a slash in the middle are anchored to the search root, so the
# cargo ones need **/ to also apply when fd is given a path (fd . ~).

# macOS app data. Also skips any other directory named Library.
Library/

# Rust toolchains and downloaded crate sources. Project .cargo/config.toml
# files stay visible.
.rustup/
**/.cargo/registry/
**/.cargo/git/
